KZ3 patch 2118 (rsx rounds 111-112): Botzone corner minimap diagnostics, all env-gated: KZ3_HUD_169_LOG=2 KZ3_HUD_169_LOGF=<frame>|g (g = the LD_SURF_DUMP capture frame) logs every draw of 3 frames (any target, blend state), [h169t] alpha/channel statistics of small A8R8G8B8 textures in that frame (KZ3_H169_TDIR=<dir> dumps their guest bytes), KZ3_HUD_169_DDIR, KZ3_H169_SKIP256.

